{
    "title": "Step Counter - Pedometer & BMI",
    "description": "Are you using any pedometer to track your steps? Step Counter, free step counter for you, private and accurate!\r\n\r\nStep Counter - Pedometer & BMI is easy to use, just start walking with your mobile phone. Enjoy your walking, Step Counter will count your steps.\r\n\r\nTrack on map\r\nStep Counter - Pedometer & BMI can help you track your steps on map. When you start running or walking, Step Counter - Pedometer & BMI can show your action track and help you count your activity data. \r\n\r\nDetailed reports\r\nStep Counter provides you detailed reports and graphs for daily, weekly and monthly data. We designed it for you!\r\n\r\nTraining plans\r\nDon't know how to start your first step on training? You can start with our training plans, such as 10 minutes jogging. In training mode, you can use the function to record active time, distance, and calories burned during walking training.\r\n\r\nBMI Tracking\r\nKnow your BMI data can help you keep fit. We support BMI calculate and tracking.\r\n\r\n100% Private\r\nWe do not collect your personal date or share your data with third parties.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1Important Note\r\n\u25cf To ensure the accuracy of the step tracker, please ensure your information is entered correctly in the app's settings. We need this information to calculate your walking distance and calories.\r\n\u25cf You can adjust the app's sensitivity to ensure accuracy.\r\n\u25cf Some devices may stop counting steps when the screen is locked due to your phone's internal power-saving processes.\r\n\u25cf Devices running on older versions may also stop counting steps when the screen is locked. As much as we'd love to help, we cannot solve device issues via the app.\r\n\u25cf The health information we provide is for reference. Consult your primary care physician if you need any help.\r\n\r\nFeel free to contact us if you have any queries:\r\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:support@healthapplines.com\">support@healthapplines.com</a>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you using any pedometer to track your steps? Step Counter, free step counter for you, private and accurate!<br><br>Step Counter - Pedometer &amp; BMI is easy to use, just start walking with your mobile phone. Enjoy your walking, Step Counter will count your steps.<br><br>Track on map<br>Step Counter - Pedometer &amp; BMI can help you track your steps on map. When you start running or walking, Step Counter - Pedometer &amp; BMI can show your action track and help you count your activity data. <br><br>Detailed reports<br>Step Counter provides you detailed reports and graphs for daily, weekly and monthly data. We designed it for you!<br><br>Training plans<br>Don&#39;t know how to start your first step on training? You can start with our training plans, such as 10 minutes jogging. In training mode, you can use the function to record active time, distance, and calories burned during walking training.<br><br>BMI Tracking<br>Know your BMI data can help you keep fit. We support BMI calculate and tracking.<br><br>100% Private<br>We do not collect your personal date or share your data with third parties.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1Important Note<br>\u25cf To ensure the accuracy of the step tracker, please ensure your information is entered correctly in the app&#39;s settings. We need this information to calculate your walking distance and calories.<br>\u25cf You can adjust the app&#39;s sensitivity to ensure accuracy.<br>\u25cf Some devices may stop counting steps when the screen is locked due to your phone&#39;s internal power-saving processes.<br>\u25cf Devices running on older versions may also stop counting steps when the screen is locked. As much as we&#39;d love to help, we cannot solve device issues via the app.<br>\u25cf The health information we provide is for reference. Consult your primary care physician if you need any help.<br><br>Feel free to contact us if you have any queries:<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:support@healthapplines.com\">support@healthapplines.com</a>",
